&lt;p&gt;Here is my fork: &lt;a rel=&quot;noreferrer external&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;seniormars&#x2F;redux&quot;&gt;Redux&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
